<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
.container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
.header { border-bottom: 2px solid #566270; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.title { color: #566270; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; }
.details { background: #F5F7FA; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 16px 0; }
.details div { margin: 2px 0; }
.cta { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; padding: 10px 18px; background: #338F6E; color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
.footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 12px; }
</style></head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <div class="title">SurgicalHub — Nouvelle demande Catalogue</div>
  </div>

  <p>Bonjour {{ firstname }},</p>

  <p>Un instrumentiste a proposé un(e) {{ kindLabel }} qui n'existe pas encore dans le catalogue :</p>

  <div class="details">
    <div><strong>{{ label }}</strong></div>
    {% if requesterName %}<div>Demandé par : {{ requesterName }}</div>{% endif %}
    {% if siteName %}<div>Établissement : {{ siteName }}</div>{% endif %}
  </div>

  <p>Cette demande attend votre décision.</p>

  <p><a class="cta" href="{{ requestsUrl }}">Examiner la demande</a></p>

  <p><a href="{{ requestsUrl }}">{{ requestsUrl }}</a></p>

  <p>Bien à vous,<br>SurgicalHub</p>

  {% include 'emails/_notification_preferences_cta.html.twig' %}

  <div class="footer">SurgicalHub — document confidentiel</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
